# AdsWeb Implementation Plan

## Phase 2 Objectives: Snippets Engine & Whole App Polish

- [ ] **Developer Snippets Engine ("snip")**:
  - Create `data/snippets.json` with 60 production-grade developer code snippets (TypeScript, React 19, Next.js 14, Node.js, Python, Rust, Go, Docker, SQL, CSS).
  - Create `app/snippets/[slug]/page.tsx` with syntax highlighting, 1-click copy feedback, explanation, and editorial ads.
  - Wire up Snippets into `components/Dashboard.tsx` and `components/Sidebar.tsx` with live counts and search filters.
  - Update `app/sitemap.ts` to index all 60 snippet routes (expanding total index to >500 pages).

- [ ] **Functional Interactive Workbench for Apps**:
  - Replace static textarea in `app/apps/[slug]/page.tsx` with a fully interactive client component `components/AppWorkbench.tsx`.
  - Implements live evaluation (JSON formatter, Base64 encoder, Word counter, Hash/regex tester, Math calculator) with copy output and execution latency telemetry.

- [ ] **Suspense, Lazy Loading & UI/UX Polish**:
  - Wrap Dashboard content blocks in React `Suspense` with bespoke liquid glass skeleton cards.
  - Wire `components/StatusBar.tsx` into the dashboard with live telemetry (page counts, ad network status, build version).
  - Add Back-to-Top liquid glass floating dock on long reading pages.

- [ ] **Verification & Context Update**:
  - Build static pages with `npm run build` (>500 pages).
  - Update `.context` and `.error`.
